# STATION 12: NPC control (rename, spawn, despawn) and objective extras (lines, cancel).
npc: @test_npc
title: Station 12 - NPC control and objectives
speaker: Tester

== start
TEST 12: NPC control and objective extras. Objective_Gather is "{objective("Objective_Gather")}". Can you start ObjectiveLine_Test: {objective_line("ObjectiveLine_Test")}.
-> Rename me to "Renamed Tester" (expect the nameplate above me to change, and to stay changed after a restart)
    <<npc_name "Renamed Tester">>
    <<jump start>>
-> Give me my station name back
    <<npc_name "12 - NPC control and objectives">>
    <<jump start>>
-> Spawn a helper two blocks to your right (expect a new NPC facing you, with a dialogue of its own)
    <<spawn Kweebec_Merchant @spawned_helper 2 0 0>>
    Talk to it: the tag gives it test_spawned.talk, which no other merchant has. It despawns itself when you
    are done with it.
    <<jump start>>
-> Start Objective_Gather, then cancel it (expect it to appear in your tracker and vanish again)
    <<set $objective_runs = $objective_runs + 1>>
    <<objective Objective_Gather>>
    Started it. Press Continue to cancel it.
    <<objective cancel Objective_Gather>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Start the objective line ObjectiveLine_Test (expect the line's first objective to appear in your tracker)
    <<set $line_runs = $line_runs + 1>>
    <<objective line ObjectiveLine_Test>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Start Objective_LowTalk_Talk (expect a tracker entry "Talk to the station 1 tester"; it completes when you talk to station 1)
    <<set $talk_runs = $talk_runs + 1>>
    <<objective Objective_LowTalk_Talk>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
